        "action": "Grant anonymity to individuals accused of sexual assault until a guilty verdict",
        "additional_details": "This could help protect the reputation and privacy of those who may be innocent, and will result in individuals only being named until they are found guilty in a court of law.",
        "background": "Automatically grant anonymity to individuals accused of rape or sexual assault, which prevents them from being named publicly, until a court reaches a guilty verdict.",
